<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON, South Africa 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa</p>
<p>beat India by six wickets in their triangular series day/night</p>
<p>international on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 232-5 innings closed; South Africa 236-4 in</p>
<p>49.2 overs.</p>
</text>
